  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: NULL pointer dereference in mod_md\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106023.patch: decline requests without a\n       hostname in modules/md. Backported from httpd commit 1b47e95c61.\n     - CVE-2026-106023\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: stack buffer overflow in mod_vhost_alias\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-109163.patch: fix off-by-one size check in\n       vhost_alias_checkspace(). Backported from httpd commit 5566851a06.\n     - CVE-2026-109163\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: race condition in mod_http2\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-119618.patch: set Content-Length on the\n       request's own headers table in assign_headers(). Backported from\n       httpd commit 824beab9b9.\n     - CVE-2026-119618",
